# Git safety

Allowed by default:
- inspect status/log/diff;
- create bounded working changes;
- create a local branch when the task requires it.

Require explicit mission authority before:
- force push;
- history rewrite;
- deleting shared branches/tags;
- merging protected branches;
- publishing releases;
- pushing consequential migration changes;
- changing CI/CD credentials or deployment targets.

Prefer a clean diff and preserve unrelated user changes.
